      "raw_output": "SCORE: B1\nEXPLANATION: The text is a straightforward connected text that links a series of ideas into a linear sequence to describe interpretations of images. The writer expresses opinions and predictions about factual/speculative matters (\"there will be a sharp devaluation,\" \"it indicates that a huge meteorite will come into collision\"). While there are grammatical errors and some awkward phrasing (\"plant nebats,\" \"any dumping ground of the space of the universe,\" \"before everything mentioned above happen\"), the writer successfully communicates complex ideas and uses a variety of connectors to link discrete elements (\"Because of,\" \"As a result of this,\" \"As for,\" \"After all\"). The text moves beyond the simple sentence structures of A2 by attempting to explain cause and effect, which is consistent with B1 descriptors. It does not reach B2 because it lacks the systematic development of a cohesive argument and the sophisticated synthesis of information required for that level. CEFR level: B1.\nCONFIDENCE: 0.90",
